  "description": "Tactical starship combat for Starfinder Second Edition: player and NPC starships, battle stations, a zone-based Sensor Map, starship hazards and a data-driven action engine. Every PC keeps their normal initiative and turn; the player ship gets no extra turn. Also supports PF2e with active SF2e Anachronism.",
